><span begin="00:25.270" end="00:27.040">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.640" end="00:32.050"><span begin="00:27.640" end="00:28.450">Boy </span><span begin="00:28.450" end="00:28.510">I've </span><span begin="00:28.510" end="00:28.900">been </span><span begin="00:28.900" end="00:30.100">raised </span><span begin="00:30.100" end="00:30.370">from </span><span begin="00:30.370" end="00:30.520">the </span><span begin="00:30.520" end="00:32.050">dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.080" end="00:35.020"><span begin="00:32.080" end="00:32.380">No </span><span begin="00:32.380" end="00:32.530">one </span><span begin="00:32.530" end="00:32.860">even </span><span begin="00:32.860" end="00:33.280">knows </span><span begin="00:33.280" end="00:33.580">how </span><span begin="00:33.580" end="00:33.940">hard </span><span begin="00:33.940" end="00:34.330">life </span><span begin="00:34.330" end="00:35.020">was</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.230" end="00:38.530"><span begin="00:35.230" end="00:35.530">I </span><span begin="00:35.530" end="00:35.710">don't </span><span begin="00:35.710" end="00:36.070">even </span><span begin="00:36.070" end="00:36.400">think </span><span begin="00:36.400" end="00:36.790">about </span><span begin="00:36.790" end="00:36.910">it </span><span begin="00:36.910" end="00:37.240">now </span><span begin="00:37.240" end="00:38.530">because</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.890" end="00:43.840"><span begin="00:38.890" end="00:39.130">I've </span><span begin="00:39.130" end="00:40.450">finally </span><span begin="00:40.450" end="00:41.350">found </span><span begin="00:41.350" end="00:43.840">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.900" end="00:45.370"><span begin="00:43.900" end="00:43.990">Oh</span><span begin="00:43.990" end="00:43.990">, </span><span begin="00:43.990" end="00:44.380">sing </span><span begin="00:44.380" end="00:44.500">it </span><span begin="00:44.500" end="00:44.680">to </span><span begin="00:44.680" end="00:45.370">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.610" end="00:48.490"><span begin="00:45.610" end="00:45.880">Now </span><span begin="00:45.880" end="00:46.120">my </span><span begin="00:46.120" end="00:46.330">life </span><span begin="00:46.330" end="00:46.420">is </span><span begin="00:46.420" end="00:46.900">sweet </span><span begin="00:46.900" end="00:47.170">like </span><span begin="00:47.170" end="00:48.490">cinnamon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.330" end="00:51.850"><span begin="00:49.330" end="00:49.600">Like </span><span begin="00:49.600" end="00:49.660">a </span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.660">*</span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.660">*</span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.660">*</span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.660">*</span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.660">*</span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.660">*</span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.660">* </span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:50.170">dream </span><span begin="00:50.170" end="00:50.530">I'm </span><span begin="00:50.530" end="00:51.400">living </span><span begin="00:51.400" end="00:51.850">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.060" end="00:58.480"><span begin="00:52.060" end="00:52.510">Baby </span><span begin="00:52.510" end="00:52.750">love </span><span begin="00:52.750" end="00:52.900">me </span><span begin="00:52.900" end="00:53.200">'cause </span><span begin="00:53.200" end="00:53.320">I'm </span><span begin="00:53.320" end="00:53.800">playing </span><span begin="00:53.800" end="00:54.010">on </span><span begin="00:54.010" end="00:54.100">the </span><span begin="00:54.100" end="00:55.300">radio</span><span begin="00:55.300" end="00:55.360">（</span><span begin="00:55.360" end="00:55.540">How </span><span begin="00:55.540" end="00:55.930">do </span><span begin="00:55.930" end="00:56.110">you </span><span begin="00:56.110" end="00:56.530">like </span><span begin="00:56.530" end="00:56.920">me </span><span begin="00:56.920" end="00:58.150">now</span><span begin="00:58.150" end="00:58.310">?</span><span begin="00:58.310" end="00:58.480">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.480" end="01:01.330"><span begin="00:58.480" end="00:58.720">Lick </span><span begin="00:58.720" end="00:58.930">me </span><span begin="00:58.930" end="00:59.140">up </span><span begin="00:59.140" end="00:59.260">and </span><span begin="00:59.260" end="00:59.560">take </span><span begin="00:59.560" end="00:59.680">me </span><span begin="00:59.680" end="00:59.950">like </span><span begin="00:59.950" end="01:00.040">a </span><span begin="01:00.040" end="01:01.330">vitamin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.630" end="01:04.630"><span begin="01:01.630" end="01:01.930">cause </span><span begin="01:01.930" end="01:02.050">my </span><span begin="01:02.050" end="01:02.470">body's </span><span begin="01:02.470" end="01:02.740">sweet </span><span begin="01:02.740" end="01:02.860">like </span><span begin="01:02.860" end="01:03.250">sugar </span><span begin="01:03.250" end="01:03.730">venom</span><span begin="01:03.730" end="01:03.730">, </span><span begin="01:03.730" end="01:04.000">oh </span><span begin="01:04.000" end="01:04.630">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.840" end="01:12.400"><span begin="01:04.840" end="01:05.290">Baby </span><span begin="01:05.290" end="01:05.560">love </span><span begin="01:05.560" end="01:05.680">me </span><span begin="01:05.680" end="01:05.980">'cause </span><span begin="01:05.980" end="01:06.100">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.100" end="01:06.580">playing </span><span begin="01:06.580" end="01:06.790">on </span><span begin="01:06.790" end="01:06.880">the </span><span begin="01:06.880" end="01:08.170">radio</span><span begin="01:08.170" end="01:08.410">（</span><span begin="01:08.410" end="01:08.470">How </span><span begin="01:08.470" end="01:08.710">do </span><span begin="01:08.710" end="01:09.220">you </span><span begin="01:09.220" end="01:09.310">like </span><span begin="01